# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files.
**

# The image packages a prebuilt binary — the Go source is never copied in, so
# the only thing the build context needs is the per-arch manager binary that
# the compile step (CI) or `make docker-build` (local) writes here.
!dist/manager-*
